    "detailed_description": "Welcome, pilot! Are you ready for your first combat mission in &quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot;? This game is your chance to become a true ace of aerial battles. Buckle up and listen closely!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/4a4d27313d5b604320e06441736cc41e.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>In &quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot; you'll be piloting various aircraft, each with unique characteristics. Your task is to leverage the strengths of your plane to get behind your opponent and attack. But remember, your enemy is also on high alert and will do everything to throw you off course!<br><br>Gameplay:<br>*Each player moves simultaneously with their opponent, playing a movement card for their aircraft.<br>*Then, the planes move across the field.<br>*If your plane ends up behind the enemy and your movement card included an attack, you strike your opponent.<br>*Special movement cards allow for deceptive maneuvers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6799c0396d8f65d108e710d048a79736.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>Game Modes:<br>Single Player Mode: Train against a smart AI that predicts your actions and challenges you at every turn.<br>Multiplayer: Test your skills in duels against pilots from around the world. Prove you\u2019re the best!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/4a4d27313d5b604320e06441736cc41e.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.poster.avif?t=1735394242\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.webm?t=1735394242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.mp4?t=1735394242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>*Diverse Aircraft: Pilot various planes with unique characteristics such as speed, damage, and maneuverability.<br>*Short matches of 2 minutes. Become the king of the sky by achieving a series of victories!<br>*Tactical Maneuvers: Use cunning maneuvers and strategies to deceive your opponent and take an advantageous position for attack.<br>*Mindgames: Anticipate your opponent\u2019s actions based on their aircraft\u2019s capabilities and their thought process.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6799c0396d8f65d108e710d048a79736.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>&quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot; isn\u2019t just a game; it\u2019s a true test of your tactical skills and ability to predict your opponent\u2019s moves. Every battle is a new story, full of tension and unexpected twists. Are you ready to become an ace of aerial combat? Ready for takeoff!<br><br>\u200b",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome, pilot! Are you ready for your first combat mission in &quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot;? This game is your chance to become a true ace of aerial battles. Buckle up and listen closely!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/4a4d27313d5b604320e06441736cc41e.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>In &quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot; you'll be piloting various aircraft, each with unique characteristics. Your task is to leverage the strengths of your plane to get behind your opponent and attack. But remember, your enemy is also on high alert and will do everything to throw you off course!<br><br>Gameplay:<br>*Each player moves simultaneously with their opponent, playing a movement card for their aircraft.<br>*Then, the planes move across the field.<br>*If your plane ends up behind the enemy and your movement card included an attack, you strike your opponent.<br>*Special movement cards allow for deceptive maneuvers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6799c0396d8f65d108e710d048a79736.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>Game Modes:<br>Single Player Mode: Train against a smart AI that predicts your actions and challenges you at every turn.<br>Multiplayer: Test your skills in duels against pilots from around the world. Prove you\u2019re the best!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/4a4d27313d5b604320e06441736cc41e.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.poster.avif?t=1735394242\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.webm?t=1735394242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6e402176d25a35b76747e27ecb8cf21f.mp4?t=1735394242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>*Diverse Aircraft: Pilot various planes with unique characteristics such as speed, damage, and maneuverability.<br>*Short matches of 2 minutes. Become the king of the sky by achieving a series of victories!<br>*Tactical Maneuvers: Use cunning maneuvers and strategies to deceive your opponent and take an advantageous position for attack.<br>*Mindgames: Anticipate your opponent\u2019s actions based on their aircraft\u2019s capabilities and their thought process.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196620/extras/6799c0396d8f65d108e710d048a79736.webp?t=1735394242\" width=246 height=56 /></span><br>&quot;Enemy on the Tail!&quot; isn\u2019t just a game; it\u2019s a true test of your tactical skills and ability to predict your opponent\u2019s moves. Every battle is a new story, full of tension and unexpected twists. Are you ready to become an ace of aerial combat? Ready for takeoff!<br><br>\u200b",
    "short_description": "\u201cEnemy on the Tail!\u201d is a turn-based tactical dueling game about aerial combat. Choose your plane, use its unique traits, anticipate enemy moves, and attack! Or shake off enemies with clever maneuvers! Train against AI and compete with friends online. Ready for takeoff?",
